# 0013 — quest.update gets op:note (a step note WITHOUT a tick) and op:untick (repair a step ticked in error), and a
# description that is true.
# Status: NOT APPLIED (opt-in; scripts/setup-station.sh skips it until this line is changed). Owners: tools (the patch),
# risk (it changes what an agent may write to quest state). The live tool path is covered by StarNet's tool tests, not
# yet by an agent run against a running station: the first note/untick after enabling it is the real test.
# Why: the tool said "progress is display only and never completes a quest", but op:progress ticks the step
# (quests.js 'progress' -> store.tickStep -> done = true) and nothing could undo it. An agent that wanted to write a
# caveat on an unfinished step had to tick it, and a wrong tick was permanent. (company/HANDOFFS.md says there is no
# 'note' op; change it together with this line when the patch is enabled.)
# What it changes (agent-scoped exactly like progress: store.openForAgent):
#   sidecar/quest-store.js           noteStep(id, stepKey, note): writes the note, leaves done alone; on a done step it
#                                    appends ("<old> | note: <new>"), never overwrites the tick's evidence; empty = no-op.
#                                    untickStep(id, stepKey, reason): done=false on a DONE step of an OPEN quest; reason
#                                    required, written first: "unticked: <reason> (was: <old note>)", clipped to 240.
#   sidecar/tools/builtin/quests.js  ops 'note' and 'untick'; the description says progress TICKS.
#   test/quest-store.test.js, test/quests-tool.test.js   cases for both ops.
# What it does NOT do: reopen a closed quest (both ops refuse one: completion and credit stay the Commander's), or add a
# REST route (sidecar/index.js is untouched). An untick cannot reset dispatch.js's stall counter, which only resets
# when the done count rises above its recorded high-water mark.
# Apply:  git -C starnet apply --3way --whitespace=nowarn ../company/patches/0013-quest-note-and-untick.diff (restart the station)
# Revert: git -C starnet apply -R ../company/patches/0013-quest-note-and-untick.diff
